        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Headache history"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Intermittent dull band-like headache for approximately 3 weeks, frontal and temporal, sometimes occipital; 3–4/10, up to 6/10 on bad days. Worse later in the day after long bar shifts or prolonged screen use. Sleep helps; Panadol 500 mg, 1–2 tablets as needed, gives partial relief."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-2",
